## Original Content
<p>Today, Google is expanding its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with their newest course on vibe coding that helps learners move from AI users to AI builders.&#160; For decades, building software required learning to code. But now, with vibe coding, AI is making it possible for professionals across industries to build applications that automate everyday [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/google-helps-professionals-with-new-vibe-coding-course/">Google helps professionals become AI creators with new vibe coding course on Coursera</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Google has expanded its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with a new course focused on vibe coding. This course enables professionals to transition from AI users to AI builders by using AI to develop applications without traditional coding. It aims to help automate everyday tasks across various industries.

## Key Points
- Google launched a new vibe coding course on Coursera as part of its AI Professional Certificate.
- Vibe coding is a technology that allows application development with AI assistance, eliminating the need for traditional coding skills.
- The course is designed to teach professionals how to become AI creators rather than just users.
- It targets learners across industries to build applications that automate routine tasks.
- This initiative reflects a shift in software development where AI enables broader participation.


